        "jcr:created": "Thu Oct 17 2024 17:36:22 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">B</span>alance</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Loss of balance, difficulty walking, dizziness, or lack of coordination<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>Observe if the person is having trouble staying balanced. If you notice this symptom, check for additional signs.</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Oct 17 2024 18:18:12 GMT+0000",
