        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">E</span>yes</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Sudden trouble seeing in one or both eyes.<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>If the person experiencing changes in their vision, check for additional symptoms of stroke.</p>\n",
