        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
        "jcr:created": "Thu Oct 17 2024 17:36:22 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">F</span>ace</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Facial drooping and weakness<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>Look at the person’s face. Is one side of their face drooping or are they unable to move their lips up and down? If so, check for additional signs.<br>\n</p>\n",
