        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">A</span>rms</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Arm weakness<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>A stroke can cause muscle weakness and numbness on one or both sides of the body. Check to see if the person’s arm is lying limp to their side. If so, check for additional symptoms of stroke.<br>\n</p>\n",
