        "jcr:created": "Thu Oct 17 2024 17:36:22 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">S</span>peech</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Speech difficulty<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>If someone is slurring their words and you’re having a hard time understanding them, it’s time to call for help.<br>\n</p>\n",
