        "jcr:created": "Thu Oct 17 2024 17:36:22 GMT+0000",
        "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">T</span>ime</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Time to call emergency medical services if you see these signs of stroke.<sup>2</sup></h4>\n<p>Speed of care matters when it comes to stroke. If you notice someone exhibiting the symptoms above, call emergency services immediately. Ischemic strokes block the flow of blood and as a result, oxygen moving to and from the brain. Fast treatment can lessen the brain damage that stroke can cause.<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;This is why it’s so important to B.E. F.A.S.T.<br>\n</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 22 2024 19:06:11 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
